        ]
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/health/deep": {
      "get": {
        "description": "Full dependency report.\n\n``llm_adapter: \"deterministic\"`` is how a judge with no API key\nconfirms the system is running honestly in a fully-functional\nzero-credential mode rather than fabricating model output (\u00a718.3).\nChecks for subsystems not yet built report ``\"not_implemented\"`` so\nthis endpoint never lies about what exists.",
